{
  "id": "PSA.86",
  "number": "86",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 86",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "86",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 86"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "86",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prière de David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! incline ton oreille, réponds-moi ; car je suis affligé et pauvre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garde mon âme, car je suis un de [tes] saints",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; toi, mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! sauve ton serviteur qui se confie en toi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Use de grâce envers moi, Seigneur ! car je crie à toi tout le jour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Réjouis l'âme de ton serviteur ; car à toi, Seigneur, j'élève mon âme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car toi, Seigneur ! tu es bon, prompt à pardonner, et grand en bonté envers tous ceux qui crient vers toi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! prête l'oreille à ma prière, et sois attentif à la voix de mes supplications.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au jour de ma détresse je crierai vers toi, car tu me répondras.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seigneur ! nul entre les dieux n'est comme toi, et il n'y a point d'œuvres comme les tiennes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toutes les nations que tu as faites viendront et se prosterneront devant toi, Seigneur ! et elles glorifieront ton nom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car tu es grand, et tu fais des choses merveilleuses ; tu es",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", toi seul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! enseigne-moi ton chemin ; je marcherai dans ta vérité ; unis mon cœur à la crainte de ton nom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je te célébrerai de tout mon cœur, Seigneur, mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! et je glorifierai ton nom à toujours ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car ta bonté est grande envers moi, et tu as sauvé mon âme du shéol",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "profond.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! des hommes arrogants se sont levés contre moi, et l'assemblée des hommes violents cherche ma vie ; et ils ne t'ont pas mis devant eux.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais toi, Seigneur ! tu es un",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "miséricordieux et faisant grâce, lent à la colère, et grand en bonté et en vérité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tourne-toi vers moi, et use de grâce envers moi ; donne ta force à ton serviteur, et sauve le fils de ta servante.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 86:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Opère pour moi un signe de [ta] faveur, et que ceux qui me haïssent le voient et soient honteux ; car toi, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.86.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.86.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! tu m'auras aidé, et tu m'auras consolé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.86.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.86.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.87",
    "number": "87",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.85",
    "number": "85",
